config GNSS_KEPLER
	tristate "Samsung Kepler GNSS companion chip bring-up driver"
	depends on (ARCH_EXYNOS && OF) || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Bring-up driver for the Samsung "Kepler" GNSS companion chip
	  found on several Exynos-based Samsung phones.

	  Milestone 1: PMU_ALIVE power-on sequencing and fault-region
	  readback via debugfs only. No MCU_IPC mailbox protocol, no
	  BCMD, no firmware load yet -- see gnss.md in the tree root for
	  the downstream hardware investigation this is based on.

	  Say M here to build it as a module, so it can be reloaded
	  while bringing the chip up without rebuilding/reflashing the
	  kernel.
